    "body": "claimed: main session (review fixes for PR #123) · 2026-11-07T20:20Z · branch issue/89-drill-prior-removal · plan: the review BLOCKED two lathe collisions - (B1) Bore/Groove/part kinds are cut as a full-diameter flat disc and the revolved reading spreads that false removal round the bar (a holder or shank passes into uncut stock); (B2) the column grid credits a turning move under standing material (a parting kerf or ID groove) as clearing everything above - on lathes credit only the Facing kind, any other kind ahead reads raw. Also: model a drill predecessor's point cone (or drop drill predecessors), pin the lathe test with an R below the faced end that must refuse, add nose to the digest, an axial drill goes Stale on a stock change, cut_by keeps NaN as NaN.",
